  "title": "Oyster Dressing (Stuffing)",
  "description": "This oyster dressing (stuffing) recipe, with celery, onion, breadcrumbs, and spices, is full-flavored and a welcome alternative to traditional stuffing.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie Holt"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T09:49:42-04:00",
